  "description": "Test native, React Native, hybrid, and Flutter mobile apps with Appium 3.x, Detox, Maestro, and Patrol. Covers device farm setup (BrowserStack, Sauce Labs), gesture simulation, deep link and cold-start testing, push notifications, biometric (Face ID) auth, offline/poor-network simulation, and iOS/Android permission dialog handling. Use when: \"mobile test,\" \"Appium,\" \"Detox,\" \"Maestro,\" \"Patrol,\" \"Flutter test,\" \"iOS test,\" \"Android test,\" \"device farm,\" \"deep link,\" \"biometric,\" \"Face ID,\" \"permission dialog,\" \"React Native test.\" Not for: device/browser matrix strategy in the abstract — use cross-browser-testing; app startup/memory/battery profiling depth — use performance-testing; mobile screenshot diffing — use visual-testing. Related: ci-cd-integration, cross-browser-testing, performance-testing, test-data-management, test-reliability.",
